==== Opening the case ====
**Note:** This will void your warranty!

  *To remove the cover simply remove the two screws on the bottom. Then just open it to the front.
  *The board itself has no screws.

==== Serial ====
The are 4 pins on the board:

  - RX
  - GND
  - TX
  - 3V3

